'''Urs & Fenrir''' is a [[:Category:Special Cats|Special Cat]] that was added in [[Version 9.2 Update|Version 9.2]] and can be unlocked at a 30% chance when completing [[Lifesaving Shovel]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 12.0 Update|Version 12.0]] gains increased health, attack power and range, Colossus Slayer and Behemoth Slayer.

